WEBVTT

01:40.570 --> 01:45.789
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.270 --> 01:50.830
[Episode 3]

01:53.120 --> 01:55.380
[10 days later]

02:04.980 --> 02:06.910
Divine Fire Villa is in seclusion.

02:07.280 --> 02:09.380
This time, I'm taking action without permission.

02:09.380 --> 02:12.340
I hope my trip to Nangong's residence will be rewarding,

02:12.340 --> 02:14.530
and that I can save Mu Xiaowu for Yan.

02:19.240 --> 02:22.240
Master Gu and Master Cheng have arrived.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.530
Master Gu!

02:26.840 --> 02:28.000
Master Cheng.

02:29.400 --> 02:30.820
Young Master Nangong.

02:30.960 --> 02:31.750
This way.

02:32.079 --> 02:32.470
This way.

02:32.470 --> 02:32.800
After you.

02:32.800 --> 02:35.910
Master Zhou and Master Han have arrived.

02:36.079 --> 02:37.000
Young Master Nangong.

02:37.000 --> 02:38.090
Masters.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.040
Go in, please.

02:39.460 --> 02:40.520
After you.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.280
Let's go.

02:41.630 --> 02:44.560
Master Zhang Zheng has arrived.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.360
Master Zhang,

02:51.520 --> 02:52.750
the Nangong family

02:53.030 --> 02:56.150
is honored to welcome your presence.

02:57.079 --> 02:57.960
Go in, please.

03:07.890 --> 03:10.330
Dark Sword Villa...

03:13.190 --> 03:15.560
Young Master Wangquan has arrived.

03:16.270 --> 03:18.620
Young Master Yang has arrived.

03:19.590 --> 03:20.960
Young Master Wangquan,

03:20.980 --> 03:23.400
we've been waiting for you. Go in, please.

03:27.030 --> 03:28.090
Young Master Yang,

03:28.800 --> 03:30.930
the Yang family has fallen from grace.

03:31.240 --> 03:34.430
Yet you can sponge off the Wangquan family
as their son-in-law.

03:34.430 --> 03:37.190
Your life is secured.

03:43.910 --> 03:44.710
Nangong Chui,

03:45.750 --> 03:46.800
what do you want?

03:47.240 --> 03:48.500
Young Master Nangong,

03:48.870 --> 03:50.030
may I go in now?

03:53.030 --> 03:53.840
Yes, please.

04:29.270 --> 04:30.070
Yes.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.390
It's Dongfang Huaizhu.

05:11.540 --> 05:13.120
Why is she here?

05:34.600 --> 05:36.590
It seems like Nangong Ye's plan

05:37.120 --> 05:38.510
has just started.

05:40.090 --> 05:41.260
Miss Dongfang,

05:41.700 --> 05:43.390
the man seated to my right

05:43.750 --> 05:45.480
will be Young Master Wangquan.

05:45.909 --> 05:48.010
He's a conniving man.

05:48.360 --> 05:50.790
You'd better disguise as a sword attendant

05:50.920 --> 05:52.310
and stay cautious.

05:54.620 --> 05:55.850
Masters,

05:56.120 --> 05:58.200
I, Nangong Ye, am truly honored

05:58.390 --> 06:00.360
to witness with you

06:00.360 --> 06:02.190
the unveiling of the Celestial Demon Divine Sword.

06:02.190 --> 06:03.600
I am sure

06:03.830 --> 06:05.630
this will reveal a turning point

06:05.750 --> 06:09.350
for the long-standing conflict between humans and demons.

06:09.920 --> 06:10.630
Come on.

06:10.630 --> 06:13.200
Let's toast to the unity of Yiqi Alliance.

06:13.770 --> 06:16.890
To the unity of Yiqi Alliance.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.860
Before the sword is brought to light,

06:22.270 --> 06:23.630
I'd like you to enjoy

06:24.090 --> 06:26.350
a little performance I prepared for you.

06:48.740 --> 06:50.490
[Flood Dragon Demon from Southern Ocean]

06:49.060 --> 06:52.680
This demon has cultivated for a thousand years.

06:52.680 --> 06:54.560
A sword made with its demon core

06:54.560 --> 06:56.560
can control all waters in the world.

06:57.530 --> 06:59.280
[Niuyang Turtle]

06:58.630 --> 07:01.560
This turtle has cultivated for 800 years.

07:02.270 --> 07:04.000
A sword made with its demon core

07:04.000 --> 07:06.000
is impervious to any kind of poison.

07:07.450 --> 07:08.630
[Fiery Kylin]

07:07.510 --> 07:10.040
There is a fiery kylin and a wind kylin.

07:09.040 --> 07:10.150
[Wind Kylin]

07:10.040 --> 07:11.640
They're the kings of beasts.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.970
A sword made with their demon cores

07:14.570 --> 07:16.160
can tame wind and resist fire.

07:16.160 --> 07:18.220
Even blades and spears can't hurt it.

08:03.730 --> 08:06.590
Master Nangong, the cores await your examination.

08:16.570 --> 08:18.120
Masters, I humbly

08:18.180 --> 08:19.510
offer these four swords

08:19.530 --> 08:21.410
to you as gifts.

08:22.920 --> 08:25.070
It's very generous of you, Master Nangong.

08:25.070 --> 08:26.830
The Cheng family would like one sword.

08:26.830 --> 08:28.630
The Gu family will take one as well.

08:28.630 --> 08:29.680
So will the Han family.

08:29.680 --> 08:31.340
The Zhou family wants one too.

08:34.110 --> 08:35.440
Young Master Wangquan,

08:36.390 --> 08:37.789
are you interested

08:37.789 --> 08:39.630
in getting one of such swords?

08:40.200 --> 08:42.400
It's kind of you to ask, Master Nangong.

08:42.400 --> 08:44.500
I already have Wangquan Sword.

08:46.130 --> 08:47.130
It's all I need.

10:39.020 --> 10:40.480
What kind of power is this?

10:40.850 --> 10:42.450
Why does it feel so familiar?

10:42.990 --> 10:44.260
Could it be...

10:53.330 --> 10:54.660
Young Master Wangquan.

10:57.360 --> 10:58.470
Master Nangong,

10:59.790 --> 11:00.910
the music and the dance

11:00.910 --> 11:02.120
were both amazing.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.870
I was held spellbound.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.080
Huaizhu,

11:09.260 --> 11:10.750
get ready

11:10.890 --> 11:14.760
to serve Young Master Wangquan in the guest house.

11:15.580 --> 11:18.040
Make sure you try your best to please him.

11:36.140 --> 11:38.000
Has he fallen for our trick or not?

11:38.840 --> 11:40.860
There is no way to tell. Why?

11:42.530 --> 11:44.590
So this is your trap, Master Nangong.

11:47.530 --> 11:48.820
In your opinion,

11:49.570 --> 11:52.250
has Wangquan Hongye been inflicted yet?

11:52.720 --> 11:55.470
Young Master Wangquan looks calm and composed.

11:56.030 --> 11:58.120
I suggest we probe deeper into it.

11:58.810 --> 11:59.580
Sounds good.

12:00.500 --> 12:03.480
Please observe closely when you are with him.

12:03.720 --> 12:06.000
Tomorrow, at the sword unveiling ceremony,

12:06.000 --> 12:08.530
we'll join hands to reach our ambitious goal.

12:40.750 --> 12:42.870
Nangong family's first attempt failed.

12:42.870 --> 12:44.470
They must have a backup plan.

12:50.550 --> 12:51.880
Young Master Wangquan,

12:52.790 --> 12:55.550
I'm Nangong Zhu, a sword attendant for you.

12:56.500 --> 12:57.310
Come in.

13:03.270 --> 13:04.530
I bet their backup plan

13:04.840 --> 13:06.700
is executed by Dongfang Huaizhu.

13:07.550 --> 13:09.410
I can't let her collude with them.

13:19.390 --> 13:21.120
How is your bath, Young Master?

13:21.560 --> 13:23.080
Is my service needed?

13:23.920 --> 13:24.760
No.

13:25.210 --> 13:28.160
You sound tired.

13:28.220 --> 13:30.070
Are you feeling discomfort?

13:30.610 --> 13:32.430
I'm equipped with medical skills.

13:32.430 --> 13:34.230
I can take your pulse if you want.

13:36.030 --> 13:36.970
It's late.

13:37.500 --> 13:38.760
The water is a bit cold.

13:39.840 --> 13:42.030
Perhaps the water is not cold.

13:42.180 --> 13:45.060
Maybe you feel cold because you are ill.

13:51.750 --> 13:54.640
Since you are a sword attendant,

13:55.150 --> 13:58.800
you should know good swords choose competent owners,

13:59.240 --> 14:02.100
and that chess pieces are at the players' disposal.

14:02.270 --> 14:04.040
In your eyes,

14:04.320 --> 14:05.990
am I a sword

14:06.630 --> 14:07.870
or a chess piece?

14:08.630 --> 14:09.870
That depends on you.

14:10.380 --> 14:11.980
Nangong Ye is not the only one

14:13.130 --> 14:14.860
that can give you what you want.

14:15.670 --> 14:16.590
However...

14:17.720 --> 14:19.320
The decisive factor here

14:20.540 --> 14:22.340
is how much value you have.

14:22.870 --> 14:27.310
Young master, is this a debate about chess?

14:28.550 --> 14:31.980
It's a shame that I'm not proficient in any forms of art.

14:32.390 --> 14:34.850
You take a bamboo flute with you everywhere.

14:35.270 --> 14:36.270
But it turns out

14:37.240 --> 14:38.600
just to be an ornament.

14:49.220 --> 14:53.260
I wonder when you can't bear the pain brought by the injuries.

15:31.840 --> 15:33.500
You're not a sword attendant.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.640
What exactly do you want?

15:36.440 --> 15:37.960
That doesn't matter.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.860
The important thing is

15:40.660 --> 15:42.210
that you are injured.

15:42.690 --> 15:45.000
You will soon collapse.

15:46.960 --> 15:47.790
That is

15:48.870 --> 15:50.600
an alarmists remark, isn't it?

15:52.550 --> 15:54.960
These are Jiaye Bells.

15:56.080 --> 15:59.280
Apparently, Nangong family set up Bell Sound Formations

15:59.510 --> 16:02.670
to welcome you at the dinner party.

16:03.630 --> 16:04.750
These formations

16:04.750 --> 16:06.510
would gradually deprive you

16:07.080 --> 16:08.410
of all your five senses,

16:09.120 --> 16:11.200
except your sense of touch.

16:13.510 --> 16:15.770
First, it'd take away the sense of taste.

16:18.000 --> 16:19.400
Then, the sense of smell.

16:21.550 --> 16:22.670
But now,

16:24.150 --> 16:25.390
I'm feeling fine.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.440
Young Master,

16:31.240 --> 16:32.390
smell this.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.650
No floral scent at all.

16:48.190 --> 16:49.250
What did you smell?

16:49.520 --> 16:51.780
Was there a lingering floral fragrance?

16:53.460 --> 16:54.790
I don't feel threatened

16:55.880 --> 16:57.210
by such minor injuries.

16:57.270 --> 16:59.910
Okay. Let me give it a try.

17:52.270 --> 17:53.870
Under these circumstances,

17:54.090 --> 17:56.310
you're still able to hold your sword tight.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.510
How admirable.

18:09.100 --> 18:11.030
Senior, there is a sound over there.

18:11.030 --> 18:12.360
Let's wait and observe.

18:16.030 --> 18:18.590
As I expected, you pretended to be fine
in order to protect yourself

18:18.590 --> 18:19.990
from the Nangong family.

18:20.030 --> 18:21.420
Now that you know it,

18:22.310 --> 18:24.470
why are you still helping the evil?

18:24.830 --> 18:27.830
Nangong Ye and you are both members of Yiqi Alliance.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.310
It's too soon to tell

18:29.680 --> 18:31.000
who is evil, isn't it?

18:33.200 --> 18:34.200
Miss Huaizhu,

18:35.030 --> 18:36.550
a wise bird would choose a stable perch.

18:36.550 --> 18:37.880
Young Master Wangquan,

18:37.960 --> 18:40.420
a phoenix would only land where treasure is.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.680
You're in a dead end.

19:03.970 --> 19:06.400
I'm surprised you're still hanging in there.

19:06.400 --> 19:07.550
Wangquan Hongye,

19:09.030 --> 19:10.290
You've done your best.

20:00.970 --> 20:05.300
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

20:04.350 --> 20:05.590
Nangong Ye,

20:06.270 --> 20:09.270
I've taught you to how make swords with demon cores.

20:08.480 --> 20:10.440
[Black Fox]

20:09.270 --> 20:10.920
I hope you won't be a disappointment.

20:10.870 --> 20:14.190
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

20:11.960 --> 20:14.000
This plan is flawless.

20:16.270 --> 20:19.260
It's Wangquan Hongye's honor to be the first one

20:19.740 --> 20:22.420
that my demon sword kills.

20:22.680 --> 20:28.230
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

20:24.960 --> 20:28.030
Soon I'll be the ruler of Yiqi Alliance.

21:11.170 --> 21:12.070
With this spell's help,

21:12.070 --> 21:13.350
you can temporarily share

21:13.350 --> 21:14.960
my sight and hearing.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.590
But you must stay within five steps around me.

21:17.590 --> 21:18.920
Young Master Wangquan,

21:19.310 --> 21:20.170
I'm sorry.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.200
You've woken up.

21:50.810 --> 21:51.830
Have some tea.

22:34.000 --> 22:35.310
You healed me.

22:36.200 --> 22:38.350
I've got my senses back.

22:40.030 --> 22:41.690
You're being too optimistic.

22:42.580 --> 22:44.150
It's a beautiful night.

22:44.460 --> 22:46.730
Why don't you go outside for fresh air

22:46.760 --> 22:48.080
and a look around?

22:58.240 --> 22:59.070
One.

23:00.550 --> 23:01.350
Two.

23:03.030 --> 23:03.830
Three.

23:06.000 --> 23:06.830
Four.

23:12.920 --> 23:13.720
Five.

23:23.550 --> 23:24.400
Six.

23:38.110 --> 23:39.700
Within five steps around me,

23:39.700 --> 23:41.590
you can hear and see everything.

23:41.590 --> 23:43.050
All is under your control.

23:43.920 --> 23:45.650
But if you go farther than that,

23:45.880 --> 23:46.980
I can't help you

23:47.060 --> 23:48.480
with anything.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.150
I see.

24:00.790 --> 24:02.310
You're very good at

24:03.460 --> 24:04.870
handling the scale.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.070
Now,

24:09.000 --> 24:10.200
will you agree

24:10.720 --> 24:12.270
to partner with me?

24:14.640 --> 24:15.440
Tell me,

24:15.570 --> 24:17.460
what has your master planned for tomorrow's

24:17.460 --> 24:18.680
sword revealing ceremony?

24:18.680 --> 24:20.590
I'm just a nobody.

24:20.610 --> 24:23.090
I truly don't know the master's plan.

24:25.160 --> 24:26.160
Well,

24:26.190 --> 24:28.520
what are your young master's weaknesses?

24:28.590 --> 24:30.250
He's mean to people.

24:30.360 --> 24:32.180
He likes hitting people's faces.

24:32.180 --> 24:33.770
He never says anything nice.

24:33.770 --> 24:34.800
He's stingy.

24:34.920 --> 24:36.590
He's mean and vain.

24:37.060 --> 24:40.060
In the back of his head, there's a bald spot on the left.

24:45.220 --> 24:46.640
I just wanted to test

24:46.640 --> 24:49.160
this tool I got from Hongye.

24:50.830 --> 24:52.690
You've been testing it all night.

24:53.620 --> 24:55.190
It's time to stop.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.320
Besides, your mind control technique

24:57.320 --> 24:59.220
might not work on those with a strong will.

24:59.220 --> 25:00.750
These guys are all too weak.

25:00.770 --> 25:02.900
They are not qualified test subjects.

25:03.400 --> 25:04.640
How do you know

25:04.660 --> 25:06.510
I can't control people with a strong will?

25:06.510 --> 25:08.830
Do you dare to look into my eyes?

25:31.270 --> 25:32.400
You have three eyes.

25:32.400 --> 25:33.860
I can't control your mind.

25:49.400 --> 25:50.310
Who are you?

25:50.990 --> 25:52.850
What's the purpose of your visit?

25:54.510 --> 25:57.210
Why don't you take a guess, Young Master?

25:58.070 --> 25:59.980
I guess you're not a sword attendant,

25:59.980 --> 26:02.910
but someone hired by Nangong Ye to hurt me.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.110
Knowing you would be up against me

26:05.110 --> 26:07.370
didn't stop you from taking on this task.

26:07.370 --> 26:10.330
There must be something extraordinary about you.

26:13.620 --> 26:15.580
So, Young Master, do you think

26:16.070 --> 26:17.670
I'm here to assassinate you?

26:17.750 --> 26:18.920
I believe

26:19.750 --> 26:20.880
that a smart

26:21.100 --> 26:23.160
and composed person like you

26:23.540 --> 26:25.000
can tell right from wrong

26:25.270 --> 26:28.240
and avoid being Nangong Ye's killing tool.

26:29.790 --> 26:30.640
Indeed,

26:31.400 --> 26:34.750
Nan Gong Ye described you as utterly evil.

26:35.110 --> 26:36.880
A recluse though I am,

26:36.960 --> 26:38.550
I'm not ignorant.

26:38.790 --> 26:40.590
I'm fairly aware of

26:41.270 --> 26:43.130
what the Nangong family has done.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.510
Then, what is

26:45.720 --> 26:46.780
your real purpose?

26:47.960 --> 26:49.240
As you said,

26:49.720 --> 26:51.790
a wise bird would choose a stable perch.

26:51.790 --> 26:53.750
Nangong Ye wants you dead.

26:54.070 --> 26:55.590
If I save your life,

26:56.400 --> 26:58.070
I can get from you

26:58.510 --> 27:00.880
what he promised to give me.

27:03.510 --> 27:04.320
I see.

27:05.790 --> 27:08.250
A phoenix would only land where treasure is.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.830
Miss, would you

27:10.790 --> 27:12.200
go to a place

27:13.030 --> 27:14.070
with me?

27:14.640 --> 27:17.490
I need your help.

27:18.490 --> 27:21.620
The Nangong spies are still outside.

27:22.270 --> 27:23.870
How will you leave this room?

27:26.480 --> 27:28.010
An invisibility talisman?

27:33.330 --> 27:34.460
Why is the door open?

27:35.440 --> 27:36.430
Something's wrong.

27:36.430 --> 27:37.960
Go tell Master now!

27:47.370 --> 27:49.240
Where exactly are we going?

27:49.440 --> 27:50.970
The Nangong Sword Furnace.

27:51.200 --> 27:53.270
It's at the end of this stone path.

27:53.880 --> 27:55.830
The Nangong Sword Furnace is an important place.

27:55.830 --> 27:58.290
Yet we haven't seen a single guard on our way.

27:58.680 --> 28:00.540
Is there something we don't know?

28:01.470 --> 28:02.800
You're quite perceptive.

28:02.800 --> 28:05.440
Nangong Ye has set a Mystical Bell Formation outside the sword furnace.

28:05.440 --> 28:07.270
Once it is activated, no one can break through.

28:07.270 --> 28:09.470
There are no guards around the furnace.

28:10.110 --> 28:10.550
However...

28:10.550 --> 28:11.310
However,

28:11.310 --> 28:14.070
Nangong Ye will soon realize you've gone missing.

28:14.070 --> 28:15.930
The place he is most worried about

28:16.110 --> 28:17.110
is the Nangong Sword Furnace.

28:17.110 --> 28:17.920
That's right.

28:18.240 --> 28:19.440
The clock is ticking.

28:19.750 --> 28:21.080
Go ahead, Young Master.

28:36.440 --> 28:39.240
The color of these maple leaves seems odd.

28:40.880 --> 28:42.750
It's because the demons whose cores were taken out

28:42.750 --> 28:43.750
were buried here.

28:47.510 --> 28:50.750
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

28:47.730 --> 28:49.920
This Mystical Bell Formation is exclusive to the Nangong family.

28:49.920 --> 28:52.130
Each string of Jiaye Bells has nine layers.

28:52.130 --> 28:53.400
The deeper one goes,

28:53.550 --> 28:55.030
the stronger demonic energy one feels.

28:53.670 --> 28:57.270
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

28:55.880 --> 28:57.200
All hasty intruders

28:57.320 --> 28:58.880
will eventually go insane.

29:00.350 --> 29:02.310
The sound of the bells drives people

29:02.310 --> 29:04.440
crazy only when it reaches their ears.

29:05.160 --> 29:06.350
What if

29:06.750 --> 29:07.790
you can't hear it?

29:09.030 --> 29:10.720
When I go farther than five steps away from you,

29:10.720 --> 29:12.750
I can't hear or see anything.

29:13.310 --> 29:15.170
Then how do I get through the formation?

29:15.170 --> 29:16.610
What if I can guide you out

29:17.590 --> 29:20.640
though you can't hear or see anything?

31:25.860 --> 31:26.790
Are you alright?

31:29.790 --> 31:31.200
Thank you, genuinely.

31:32.030 --> 31:32.760
My pleasure.

31:44.400 --> 31:46.000
Indeed, there are no guards.

31:46.730 --> 31:49.150
You must've done thorough preparation.

31:51.720 --> 31:54.290
[Sword Furnace]
[Nangong's Residence]

32:34.780 --> 32:36.670
Who are you?

32:34.800 --> 32:36.560
[Bifang Bird Demon]
[Nan]

32:40.270 --> 32:41.740
Miss, don't touch me.

32:41.830 --> 32:43.400
There's fire on me.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.790
You could get burned.

32:46.270 --> 32:47.380
Your name is Nan?

32:48.960 --> 32:49.830
You are...

32:50.310 --> 32:51.870
She's a Bifang bird demon,

32:52.030 --> 32:53.490
from the Divine Bird Clan.

32:54.280 --> 32:56.740
You must've just taken human form recently.

32:59.510 --> 33:01.000
I will get you out of here now.

33:01.000 --> 33:02.510
Miss, I can't leave here.

33:02.640 --> 33:03.880
They said

33:03.880 --> 33:05.460
when the sword was forged,

33:05.590 --> 33:08.080
my mom would come back.

33:20.720 --> 33:22.030
Your mom

33:23.350 --> 33:24.310
is in there?

33:26.400 --> 33:27.940
A man told me

33:28.030 --> 33:31.000
that they would only borrow Mom's demon core for a while,

33:31.000 --> 33:32.680
and that if I listened to them

33:32.680 --> 33:34.590
and helped them make a precious sword,

33:34.590 --> 33:36.940
my mom would come back.

33:41.200 --> 33:42.550
Who said that to you?

33:43.000 --> 33:44.200
Was it Nangong Ye?

33:50.810 --> 33:51.830
Over there!

33:52.570 --> 33:53.460
Be careful!

33:56.750 --> 33:57.440
This way!

34:06.200 --> 34:07.910
Shoot the little one!

34:08.190 --> 34:09.590
When the little one is down,

34:09.590 --> 34:11.330
the older one can't escape.

34:14.580 --> 34:15.510
Nan!

34:15.840 --> 34:16.630
Run!

34:17.620 --> 34:19.000
Mom, run!

34:19.000 --> 34:20.929
Come back to rescue me when you can!

34:30.400 --> 34:32.600
Young Master, the older one got away.

34:32.770 --> 34:34.429
She's at the demon king level.

34:35.170 --> 34:37.150
There's something you don't know.

34:37.870 --> 34:39.610
A demon's motherhood

34:40.030 --> 34:43.000
can be as strong as a human's.

34:43.710 --> 34:45.840
She won't go away.

35:06.660 --> 35:09.150
[Bifang Bird Demon]
[Nan's Mother]

35:07.070 --> 35:08.070
Release Nan.

35:10.030 --> 35:11.190
I'll go with you.

35:18.130 --> 35:19.260
Mom...

35:20.110 --> 35:21.360
Where is my mom?

35:28.040 --> 35:29.160
Your name is Nan?

35:31.440 --> 35:33.030
Is there demon fire

35:33.590 --> 35:35.790
in every member of the Divine Bird Clan?

35:39.680 --> 35:40.870
Listen,

35:41.000 --> 35:41.950
Nan,

35:41.980 --> 35:45.180
I just need to borrow your mom's demon core to make a sword.

35:45.190 --> 35:48.510
Demon cores can regenerate.

35:49.230 --> 35:50.920
Your mom is recuperating.

35:51.630 --> 35:54.110
If you help me finish making the sword,

35:54.590 --> 35:56.800
I will let you and your mom reunite.

35:57.980 --> 35:58.830
Okay?

36:01.180 --> 36:02.650
How could a demon live

36:03.230 --> 36:04.670
without its demon core?

36:05.030 --> 36:06.510
He lied to a kid,

36:06.930 --> 36:08.320
and tricked the kid into using

36:08.320 --> 36:11.250
her demon fire to refine her own mother's demon core.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.560
Nangong Ye,

36:13.360 --> 36:15.690
you must redeem your sins with your blood!

36:17.230 --> 36:19.510
The forging process is coming to an end.

36:19.670 --> 36:22.940
I will see my mother again soon.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.000
He lied to you.

36:28.360 --> 36:29.320
Demon cores

36:29.840 --> 36:31.320
cannot regenerate.

36:33.780 --> 36:35.130
Your mother...

36:37.230 --> 36:38.320
is already dead.

36:41.110 --> 36:42.550
You're lying to me.

36:43.800 --> 36:46.840
I'll help you out of these talismans, okay?

37:11.810 --> 37:14.210
I'll destroy the sword furnace right away.

37:38.070 --> 37:40.510
You can't take her away now.

37:41.660 --> 37:44.860
Bifang bird demons burn their lives in exchange for fire.

37:45.070 --> 37:46.520
When the demon sword is formed,

37:46.520 --> 37:47.760
she'll die.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.710
The furnace fire must not be put out.

37:49.710 --> 37:51.670
The demon sword must be formed.

37:55.110 --> 37:57.150
I know how you're feeling now.

37:58.750 --> 38:00.010
But I have to reiterate

38:00.320 --> 38:01.920
that the fire must not be put out,

38:01.920 --> 38:03.850
and the demon sword must be formed.

38:03.870 --> 38:06.690
Otherwise, my plan will be ruined.

38:08.320 --> 38:11.180
How could you let them make a sword with demon cores?

38:11.230 --> 38:12.450
Wangquan Hongye,

38:12.790 --> 38:14.720
you're as evil as the Nangong family!

38:14.720 --> 38:15.920
Dongfang Huaizhu!

38:21.550 --> 38:22.750
You can recognize me?

38:25.490 --> 38:27.420
I don't want to give you a hard time.

38:28.310 --> 38:30.280
Please trust me one more time.

38:30.630 --> 38:32.230
I'll explain it to you later.

38:33.270 --> 38:34.910
Who's in there?

38:34.930 --> 38:37.930
How dare you trespass on these forbidden grounds.

38:37.960 --> 38:39.690
Come out now. I'll kill you!

38:50.070 --> 38:51.360
Why should I trust you?

38:54.670 --> 38:57.000
You are the one holding the chess piece now.

38:57.000 --> 38:58.440
As for where to place it,

39:00.400 --> 39:02.000
just follow your intuition.
